QuestGuidance.Register("en",387,{
[12353]="70015E42\n1\tDefeat Dunlendings south-east of Gwingris (total: 12)\tDunlendings can be found to the south-east of Gwingris. Inufileg has asked you to defeat the Dunlendings who are laying waste to the forest of Sâd Rechu.\n2\tTalk to Inufileg at Gwingris\tInufileg is at Gwingris, north-west of the Dunlending camp. You should report back to Inufileg regarding your success against the Dunlendings.\n",
[12354]="7004DA75\n1\tClean up splotches of mud in the guards' barracks (total: 10)\tMud can be found throughout the guards' barracks in Lake-town. You should clean up splotches of mud left by uncleanly guards in the guard's barracks.\n2\tTalk to Álarr\tCaptain Álarr can be found in the guards' barracks in Lake-town. You should talk to Álarr.\n",
[12355]="70062217\n1\tFind the hag of the Old Forest\tRhiangar has asked you to look for the hag of the Old Forest. The Old Forest is in north-western Cardolan.\n2\tCatch fish (total: 5)\tHenbran has asked you to bring her fish from the river. The river is located near Sarch Vorn, next to the Old Forest.\n3\tBring the fish to Henbran\tYou should bring the fish you have caught to Henbran Amon. Henbran is in the Old Forest, in north-western Cardolan.\n",
[12356]="70021AD8\n1\tDefeat half-orcs (total: 12)\030Defeat Bûzog\tHalf-orcs can be found throughout Nan Laeglin, especially where they have raided Uch-lûth farms. Siorus Brehur has asked you to repel the half-orc raiders and their leader Bûzog from Nan Laeglin.\n2\tTalk to Siorus Brehur in the Brenin's Hall\tSiorus Brehur is at the Brenin's Hall in the village of Nan Laeglin. You should return at once to Siorus Brehur with news of your success.\n",
[12357]="7002512E\n1\tDefeat half-orcs (total: 12)\tHalf-orcs can be found throughout Nan Laeglin, especially where they have raided Uch-lûth farms. Siorus Brehur has asked you to repel the half-orc raiders from the farms of his people.\n2\tTalk to Siorus Brehur in the Brenin's Hall\tSiorus Brehur is at the Brenin's Hall in the village of Nan Laeglin. You should return at once to Siorus Brehur with news of your success.\n",
[12358]="70015E3F\n1\tDefeat half-orc wolf-keepers at Barad Morlas (total: 5)\tHalf-orc wolf-keepers can be found patrolling Barad Morlas, south-west of Echad Eregion. Dornhador has asked you to defeat the half-orc wolf-keepers at Barad Morlas to help throw their efforts into disarray.\n2\tTalk to Dornhador at Echad Eregion\tDornhador is at Echad Eregion, north-east of Barad Morlas. You should return to Dornhador with news of your victory.\n",
[12359]="7005A64D\n1\tTalk to Zóva in Vérnozal\tThe hall of Vérnozal can be found in Máttugard by the Steepset. You should talk to Zóva in Vérnozal.\n2\tHail Prince Ingór in Vérnozal\tThe hall of Vérnozal can be found in Máttugard by the Steepset. You should hail Prince Ingór in Vérnozal.\n",
[12360]="7005FE53\n1\tTalk to Zóva in Vérnozal\tThe hall of Vérnozal can be found in Máttugard by the Steepset. You should talk to Zóva in Vérnozal.\n2\tHail Prince Ingór in Vérnozal\tThe hall of Vérnozal can be found in Máttugard by the Steepset. You should hail Prince Ingór in Vérnozal.\n",
[12361]="70054686\n1\tWhistle while near the Halls of Black Lore\tFaeron has asked for you to search for the Halls of Black Lore. They are somewhere in the Circle of Madness in Minas Morgul. You should find the Halls and then signal the Rangers by whistling.\n2\tTalk to Faeron\tFaeron and the rest of the Rangers have moved to the Halls of Black Lore. You should talk to Faeron.\n3\tSpeak to Rhadrog to complete 'Instance: Nothing for Nothing'\tThe time has come to enter the Halls of Black Lore. Speak to Rhadrog near the Halls to begin 'Instance: Nothing for Nothing'.\n4\tTalk to Rhadrog\tRhadrog has returned to Barad Elenath, the Star-gazers' Spire. You should talk to Rhadrog.\n",
[12362]="70021AD7\n1\tTalk to the emissary's champion in the Brenin's Hall\tThe emissary's champion is in the Brenin's Hall in Lhanuch. You should speak with the emissary's champion.\n",
[12363]="70045E89\n1\tTalk to Aragorn in the High Hall of the Houses of Healing\tAragorn is inside the High Hall of the Houses of Healing, located on the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith.\n2\tTalk to Aragorn and assist him with healing the wounded\tAragorn is inside the High Hall of the Houses of Healing, located on the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith.\n3\tTalk to Gandalf in the High Hall of the Houses of Healing\tGandalf is inside the High Hall of the Houses of Healing, located on the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith.\n",
[12364]="70042EAF\n1\tDefeat mûmakil in Southern Ithilien (total: 4)\tMûmakil can be found near enemy encampments in Southern Ithilien. You should defeat mûmakil in Southern Ithilien.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated mûmakil in Southern Ithilien.\n",
[12365]="700430D9\n1\tDefeat Morgul defilers\tMorgul defilers can be found in the Harlond, in the northmost part of Lossarnach. You should defeat the Morgul defilers in the Harlond to protect Lossarnach from their poisonous devilry.\n2\tDefeat Morgul defilers (total: 5)\tMorgul defilers can be found in the Harlond, in the northmost part of Lossarnach. You should defeat the Morgul defilers in the Harlond to protect Lossarnach from their poisonous devilry.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated the Morgul defilers at the Harlond.\n",
[12366]="700430DF\n1\tDefeat Orc look-outs\tOrc look-outs are perched at many high spots around the Harlond, especially near the entrance, in the northmost part of Lossarnach. You should dispatch a good number of Orc look-outs.\n2\tDefeat Orc look-outs (total: 6)\tOrc look-outs are perched at many high spots around the Harlond, especially near the entrance, in the northmost part of Lossarnach. You should dispatch a good number of Orc look-outs.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated the Orc look-outs at the Harlond.\n",
[12367]="70043059\n1\tDestroy the siege weapons\tThe siege weapons can be found before the Rammas Echor's southern gate, at the northmost edge of Lossarnach. You should break the Orcs' siege weapons in order to hobble, or at least slow down, their ability to do harm.\n2\tDestroy Orc trebuchets (total: 2)\030Destroy Orc ballistae (total: 3)\tThe siege weapons can be found before the Rammas Echor's southern gate, at the northmost edge of Lossarnach. You should break the Orcs' siege weapons in order to hobble, or at least slow down, their ability to do harm.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have destroyed the Orkish siege equipment at the Harlond.\n",
[12368]="7004D6FF\n1\tHithlos's vase, goblet, box, and harp can be found in Felegoth. You should seek out Hithlos's lost items.\t\n2\tBring the items you found to Hithlos\tHithlos can be found in Felegoth. You should bring the items you found to Hithlos.\n3\tPick flowers (total: 7)\tFlowers can be found in the gardens of Felegoth. You should pick flowers for Hithlos's vase.\n4\tPut the flowers in Hithlos's vase\tHithlos's vase can be found beside him in Felegoth. You should put the flowers in the vase for Hithlos.\n5\tTalk to Hithlos\tHithlos can be found in Felegoth. You should talk to Hithlos.\n",
[12369]="70054F50\n1\tTalk to Dolenthol\tDolenthol has a plan.\n2\tDestroy the first barricade\tDolenthol asked you to travel to the first barricade and destroy it.\n3\tDestroy the second barricade\tDolenthol asked you to travel to the second barricade and destroy it.\n4\tFind and defeat Shaktur\tYou should seek out Shaktur, the leader of Ugrukhôr's forces, and defeat him.\n5\tDefeat Dargásh\tYou should seek out Dargásh, the leader of Gothmog's forces, and defeat him.\n",
[12370]="70054F5A\n1\tTalk to Dolenthol\tDolenthol has a plan.\n2\tDestroy the first barricade\tDolenthol asked you to travel to the first barricade and destroy it.\n3\tDestroy the second barricade\tDolenthol asked you to travel to the second barricade and destroy it.\n4\tFind and defeat Shaktur\tYou should seek out Shaktur, the leader of Ugrukhôr's forces, and defeat him.\n5\tDefeat Dargásh\tYou should seek out Dargásh, the leader of Gothmog's forces, and defeat him.\n",
[12371]="70054F55\n1\tTalk to Dolenthol\tDolenthol has a plan.\n2\tDestroy the first barricade\tDolenthol asked you to travel to the first barricade and destroy it.\n3\tDestroy the second barricade\tDolenthol asked you to travel to the second barricade and destroy it.\n4\tFind and defeat Shaktur\tYou should seek out Shaktur, the leader of Ugrukhôr's forces, and defeat him.\n5\tDefeat Dargásh\tYou should seek out Dargásh, the leader of Gothmog's forces, and defeat him.\n",
[12372]="70054F52\n1\tTalk to Dolenthol\tDolenthol has a plan.\n2\tDestroy the first barricade\tDolenthol asked you to travel to the first barricade and destroy it.\n3\tDestroy the second barricade\tDolenthol asked you to travel to the second barricade and destroy it.\n4\tFind and defeat Shaktur\tYou should seek out Shaktur, the leader of Ugrukhôr's forces, and defeat him.\n5\tDefeat Dargásh\tYou should seek out Dargásh, the leader of Gothmog's forces, and defeat him.\n",
[12373]="70022712\n1\tTalk to Lobelia inside the Haunted Burrow\tLobelia has made her way down to the Haunted Burrow to investigate, the door of which is at the Party Tree below Bag End. You should join Lobelia in the Haunted Burrow.\n2\tTalk to Opal Goodbody to discuss the fate of the Haunted Burrow\tOpal Goodbody is at the Party Tree in Hobbiton. You should speak with Opal Goodbody to wrap your head around what just took place.\n",
[12374]="70021E80\n1\tFind Daervunn in the Mournshaws\tFind Daervunn the Ranger who has wandered into the northern reaches of the Mournshaws. It is uncertain whether he still lives, but if so it is possible he has found a path into Dunland that is unwatched by enemy eyes.\n",
[12375]="70072EFF\n1\tExamine the banner by the entrance to the Haven of Bâkhridar\tStanding by the entrance to the Haven of Bâkhridar, you consider what can be done to oppose the threat of those who dwell here.\n2\tExplore the Heirsworn tents in the north-west corner of the Haven\030Explore the Heirsworn tents in the south-west corner of the Haven\030Explore the Heirsworn tents on the central rise of the Haven\tYou should explore the various corners of the Haven of Bâkhridar and learn the mood of those who dwell here.\n3\tCompleted\tThe longer the Heirsworn Corsairs remain at the Haven of Bâkhridar, the more their complaints grow.\n",
[12376]="7004E4EC\n1\tDefeat Boskhín Wolfseye\030Defeat Vulkhós\030Defeat Iltish\tThe Jangovar are attacking Hammerstead! You should defeat the Jangovar leaders.\n2\tTalk to Lóssi\tYou should talk to Lóssi, who can be found defending Hammerstead.\n",
[12377]="70041868\n1\tThama Aklam can be found to the south-east of Ost Anglebed. Steward Malthellim has asked you to defeat the leader of the Haradrim in Thama Aklam.\t\n2\tTalk to Steward Malthellim\tSteward Malthellim can be found in the Lord's Hall in Ost Anglebed. You have defeated the leader of the Haradrim in Thama Aklam, and should now return to Steward Malthellim.\n",
[12378]="700659CB\n1\tTalk to Nanthel\tMaldor has asked you to speak with a healer in Linhir regarding Berion. Talk to Nanthel in Linhir.\n",
[12379]="700460AE\n1\tAttend to patients (total: 8)\tThe Houses of Healing can be found in the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith. Go to the High Hall, House of Remedies, or House of Rest and tend to patients.\n2\tReturn to Ioreth\tIoreth can be found in the High Hall of the Houses of Healing, on the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith. You should let Ioreth know that you have treated many patients, although there were some possessed of a strange ailment you were unable to treat.\n",
[12380]="7003FF22\n1\tSecure swans (total: 6)\tThe swans are revered by the people of Dol Amroth.\n",
[12381]="7005293A\n1\tDefend Laerlad from the approaching invaders\tBlómgard can be found in Laerlad in the Vales of Anduin. You must defend Laerlad from the approaching invaders!\n2\tDefend Laerlad from the spider invaders\030Defeat the strange spiders (total: 2)\tBlómgard can be found in Laerlad in the Vales of Anduin. You must defend Laerlad from the spider invaders.\n3\tTalk to Odahild\tOdahild can be found in Blómgard. You should talk to Odahild.\n4\tTalk to the wounded Ungoladan warrior\tThe wounded Ungoladan warrior can be found in Blómgard. You should talk to the Ungoladan and learn what you can.\n5\tTalk to Radagast\tRadagast can be found in Blómgard. You should talk to Radagast.\n",
[12382]="70062C9D\n1\tFind Adan Rhuvyg's missing handkerchief\tAdan Rhuvyg has asked you to find his missing handkerchief. The handkerchief was carried away by the wind north-west of Lintrev.\n2\tBring the handkerchief to Adan Rhuvyg\tYou should bring the handkerchief to Adan. Adan is at Lintrev.\n",
[12383]="70062CA1\n1\tTalk to Adan by the cliffs\tAdan Rhuvyg has asked you to meet him atop the nearby cliffs. The cliffs are north of the town of Lintrev.\n2\tLook out over the Stoor-vales\030Find a good look-out spot\tAdan Rhuvyg has suggested you enjoy the view from the cliffs of Lintrev.\n3\tTell Adan what you saw\tYou should talk to Adan about the view. Adan is atop the cliffs of Lintrev.\n4\tCollect the kite fabric\030Collect a spool of rope\030Collect a fallen branch\tAdan has asked you to find materials with which to make a kite. Kite materials can be found throughout Lintrev.\n5\tBring the kite materials to Adan\tYou should bring the kite materials to Adan. Adan is around Lintrev.\n",
[12384]="70066EB6\n1\tTalk to Bregon in Sardol\tBregon can be found at Sardol in the Blackroot Vale. Amathon has asked you to speak with Bregon, a seemingly-reformed freebooter from the Blackroot Vale, and learn if he knows what the Corsairs have planned in Tarlang's Crown.\n2\tFollow the road through Tarlang's Crown\tTarlang's Crown can be found by following the road south from Sardol, in the Blackroot Vale. Bregon has informed you that the Corsairs of Umbar have returned to Tarlang's Crown. You should follow the road into Tarlang's Crown and begin your search for them.\n3\tExamine the damaged barricade\tTarlang's Crown can be found by following the road south from Sardol, in the Blackroot Vale. You have found a damaged barricade on the road through Tarlang's Crown. You should examine it.\n4\tFollow the road deeper into Tarlang's Crown\tTarlang's Crown can be found by following the road south from Sardol, in the Blackroot Vale. Bregon has informed you that the Corsairs of Umbar have returned to Tarlang's Crown. You should continue to follow the road deeper into Tarlang's Crown.\n5\tExamine the abandoned encampment\tThe abandoned encampment can be found in Tarlang's Crown. You have found a small encampment abandoned by the Corsairs in Tarlang's Crown. You should examine it.\n6\tFollow the road deeper into Tarlang's Crown\tTarlang's Crown can be found by following the road south from Sardol, in the Blackroot Vale. You have found a small abandoned encampment on the road through Tarlang's Crown. You should examine it.\n7\tFind Azruthor's tent and search for any evidence of a new plot against Gondor\tAzruthor's tent can be found in Azruthor's Rue in Tarlang's Crown. Although Azruthor's encampment was left in ruins, the Corsairs of Umbar have taken up in it. You should search for Azruthor's tent.\n8\tTalk to Amathon in Sardol\tAmathon can be found in Sardol, in the Blackroot Vale. You have found no sign that the Corsairs of Umbar seek to do anything but pillage the remains of Azruthor's encampment in Tarlang's Crown. You should return to Amathon.\n",
})
